      "text": "With respect to work in City owned or\nmanaged buildings which must be performed\nimmediately in order to correct conditions\nwhich are deemed an emergency because they\nare dangerous to human life and safety or\ndetrimental to health, the Department of\nHousing Preservation and Development or\nany successor agency shall adopt a plan\nfor the letting of such emergency contracts\nto contractors appearing on a list of ap-\nproved contractors. The plan and any amend-\nment thereto shall provide as follows:",
